  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"http://nests.tribal.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Ek Lavya Model Residential School (EMRS) NESTS</a></span> has released the Tier-II Answer Key for the post of Principal, TGT, PGT, Female Staff Nurse, Hostel Warden, Junior Secretariat Assistant (JSA) and Lab Attendant. This recruitment was issued for 7267 posts. Online applying process for EMRS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 19 September 2025 to 28 October 2025. The Tier-II examination was conducted on 22 to 25 March 2026. Candidates who have appeared for this examination can download their EMRS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Tier-II Answer Key 2026 from the link provided below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Ek Lavya Model Residential School (EMRS) NESTS</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">EMRS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Tier-II Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt.No. NESTS/Adv/2025/01 dt 19-09-2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Start Date : <strong>19 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date : <strong>28 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>28 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>13, 14 &amp; 21 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>28 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>11 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>05 December 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result : <strong>31 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Final Answer Key : <strong>04 February 2026 Available</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Exam Date : <strong>22 March to 25 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Tier-II Exam City Details : <strong>03 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Tier-II Admit Card : <strong>19 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Answer Key : <strong>13 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Principal Post</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 2500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>TGT, PGT Post</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 2000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Non Teaching Post</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs.1500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>EMRS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age : <strong>30 – 50 Years (Post wise)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per EMRS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>EMRS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 7267 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Principal</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">225</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">TGT</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3962</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PGT</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1460</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Staff Nurse (Female)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">550</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Hostel Warden</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">635</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Accountant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">61</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior&nbsp;Secretariat Assistant (JSA)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">228</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Lab Attendant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">146</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>EMRS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.8527%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.1473%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.8527%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Principal</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.1473%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s Degree from a recognized institution with at least 50% marks</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor Degree in Education (B.Ed.) from NCTE</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">recognized institution with at least 50% marks&nbsp;<strong>(OR)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3 years B.Ed.-M.Ed. from NCTE-recognized institution with at least 50% marks&nbsp;<strong>(OR)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">4 years Integrated graduation degree with at least 50% marks, including B.Ed. component</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.8527%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">TGT</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.1473%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">(A) Bachelor’s Degree in Subject</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">4-year integrated graduation degree course from an NCTE-recognised institution with at least 50% marks in all subjects individually as well as in the aggregate&nbsp;<strong>(OR)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelors / Honours Degree from a recognized institution with at least 50% marks in all subjects</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>(B)</strong>&nbsp;Bachelor Degree in Education B.Ed. Degree from NCTE recognized institution with at least 50% marks<strong>&nbsp;(OR)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3 years integrated B.Ed. -M.Ed from NCTE recognized institution with at least 50% marks</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>(С)</strong>&nbsp;Qualified in the Central Teacher Eligibility Test</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.8527%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PGT</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.1473%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Integrated Post Graduate Course with at least 50% marks in aggregate, including B.Ed. component</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Post Graduation (Master) Degree</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Ed. Degree from an NCTE-recognised institution with at</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">least 50% marks<strong>(OR)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3 years B.Ed.-M.Ed. from NCTE-recognised institution with at least 50% marks&nbsp;<strong>(OR)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">4 years Integrated graduation degree with at least 50% marks, including B.Ed. component</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.8527%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Staff Nurse (Female)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.1473%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Sc. (Hons.) in Nursing from a recognized University / Institute&nbsp;<strong>(OR)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Regular course in B.Sc. Nursing from a recognized University/Institute&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>(OR)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Post Basic B.Sc. Nursing from a recognized</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">University / Institute</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Registered as a Nurse or Nurse-Midwife (RN or RM) with any State Nursing Council.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Experience</strong>&nbsp;– Two and a Half years’ experience in minimum</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">50-bedded Hospital</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.8527%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Hostel Warden</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.1473%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">4 years integrated graduation degree course of</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Regional College of Education of NCERT (OR)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor’s Degree from a recognised university /institute</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.8527%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Accountant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.1473%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bachelor’s Degree in Commerce from a recognised University/ Institute</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.8527%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior&nbsp;Secretariat Assistant (JSA)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.1473%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Senior Secondary (Class XII) certificate from a recognised Board and possessing a minimum speed of 35 words per minute in English typing or 30 words per minute in Hindi typing</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.8527%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Lab Attendant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 74.1473%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">10th Class Pass with a certificate/diploma in Laboratory technique from a recognised board/institute<strong>&nbsp;(OR)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">12th Class with Science stream from a recognised board/ institute.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download EMRS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Tier-II Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must go to the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links</strong>&nbsp;section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates must click on the <strong>Download Tier-II Answer Key </strong>link.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, the <strong>candidates</strong> will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration no.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Login ID</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Birth Date/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates have to&nbsp; <strong>submit the details</strong> by clicking on the Login button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After successful login, candidates will be able to download the <strong>Tier-II Answer Key</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Alternatively, the candidates can download their <strong>EMRS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Tier-II Answer Key</strong>&nbsp;from the official website of EMRS also</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>EMRS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Written Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Skill Test/ Practical Test (According to Posts)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Interview (If Required)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Tier-II Answer Key</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://cbseit.in/cbse/2026/emrskeyt2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Tier-II Admit Card</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://examinationservices.nic.in/AdmitCardServic